The formula for the amount of gold generated is:
1 + (rnd(dlevel+2) * rnd(30)), where dlevel is the Dlvl.
A bug in the read loop causes cnt (1 in above) to be zeroed. make gold
function randomly generates gold if amount =  0.
Using it it worse than any abuse listed in the spoiler file, though.
